  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a title=\"Applied Cooking 連結\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/applied-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Check%20out%20my%20other%20mod%20that%20connects%20Applied%20Energistics%202%20and%20Cooking%20for%20Blockheads-Link%20at%20the%20bottom-edbd7e?labelColor=154a48&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Applied Cooking 宣傳圖\" width=\"845\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Header.png\" alt=\"精緻烹飪標題\" width=\"1425\" height=\"479\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available for Forge-1.19 | 1.18 | 1.16-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Minecraft 版本徽章\" width=\"306\" height=\"28\" /> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install on-Client &amp; Server-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"精緻烹飪安裝徽章\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p><a title=\"Melon Cube 合作夥伴宣傳\" href=\"https://meloncube.net/sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Promo.png\" alt=\"精緻烹飪宣傳圖\" width=\"1425\" height=\"211\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Description.png\" alt=\"精緻烹飪描述\" width=\"1425\" height=\"141\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">這個模組能讓精緻儲存 (Refined Storage) 與廚藝大師 (Cooking for Blockheads) 互相結合！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">新增了兩個方塊（廚房站和廚房存取點）和一個物品（廚房網路卡）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">廚房站必須放置在廚房網路中，而廚房存取點則需要放入精緻儲存網路中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">廚房站扮演精緻儲存網路接收器的角色，需要與廚房網路卡綁定。然後將這張廚房網路卡放入廚房存取點（扮演精緻儲存網路發射器）中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">一切連接完成後，你就可以直接從烹飪桌使用精緻儲存網路中的物品了。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Recipes.png\" alt=\"精緻烹飪合成配方\" width=\"1425\" height=\"650\" /></p>\n<h2>方塊</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>&nbsp;</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>已連接</strong></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>未連接</strong></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>廚房站&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gtdxpLS/2021-11-05-00-14-59.png\" alt=\"廚房站（已連接）\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/MRnrBZ4/2021-11-05-00-00-52.png\" alt=\"廚房站（未連接）\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>廚房存取點&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/k1N7Xc0/2021-11-05-00-01-27.png\" alt=\"廚房存取點（已連接）\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Sm6M3MH/2021-11-04-23-58-08.png\" alt=\"廚房存取點（未連接）\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Screenshot.png\" alt=\"精緻烹飪截圖\" width=\"1808\" height=\"824\" /></p>\n<h2>社群</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a title=\"Sebastrn 的 Curseforge\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/itssebastrn/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=ItsSebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Curseforge\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn 的 Modrinth\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=e78a4e&labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Modrinth\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\" style=\"max-height: 28px;\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn 的 Twitter\" href=\"https://twitter.com/ItsSebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@ItsSebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Twitter\" width=\"159\" height=\"28\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn 的 Youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC46TYUp8WpcFub8NxuGA66A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Sebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Youtube\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn 的 Twitch\" href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/itssebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=ItsSebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitch&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Twitch\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn 的 Github\" href=\"https://github.com/Sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Sebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Github\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a title=\"Applied Cooking 連結\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/applied-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_ACLink.png\" alt=\"Applied Cooking 宣傳圖\" width=\"1808\" height=\"268\" /></a></p>",
